### Unidirectional Data Flow (UDF) Sequence Diagram

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Mobile User
    participant Compose as Jetpack Compose Screen
    participant VM as UserProfileViewModel
    participant UseCase as GetUserProfileUseCase
    participant Repo as UserRepositoryImpl
    participant LocalDB as Room SQLite Cache
    participant RemoteAPI as Retrofit API Endpoint

    User->>Compose: Taps "Refresh Profile"
    Compose->>VM: onEvent(RefreshProfile(userId))
    VM->>VM: Emit UiState.Loading
    VM-->>Compose: Renders CircularProgressIndicator
    VM->>UseCase: invoke(userId)
    UseCase->>Repo: getUserProfile(userId)

    Repo->>LocalDB: queryUserById(userId)
    LocalDB-->>Repo: Return cached UserEntity (fast emit)

    Repo->>RemoteAPI: GET /v1/users/{userId}
    RemoteAPI-->>Repo: 200 OK (UserNetworkDto)
    Repo->>LocalDB: insertUser(mappedEntity)
    Repo-->>UseCase: Result.success(mappedDomainUser)

    UseCase-->>VM: Result.success(user)
    VM->>VM: Emit UiState.Success(user)
    VM-->>Compose: Recomposes Screen with updated data
    Compose-->>User: Displays user name, email & verified badge
```

