## 6. Android PR Conformance Quality Gate

<div class="portal-checklist-box">
  <div class="portal-checklist-title">PRE-MERGE ANDROID CONFORMANCE CHECKLIST</div>
  <p>Ensure the following items pass before submitting code for review:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Layer Separation:</strong> Feature code follows <code>data/</code>, <code>domain/</code>, and <code>presentation/</code> sub-packages with single-responsibility files.</li>
